        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "We did Santa photos with this studio at Place Vertu for years. This year, they not only sent the digital photos we purchased after a month. They don't answer our calls and emails for weeks! For us it's not about money, our family are waiting for these photos overseas. I'm very disappointed and never would do our photos with them again.",
